<p>Pricing changes frequently and varies by region, contact volume, and contract term, so check the official pricing pages of every shortlisted app and model an eighteen-month total that includes a peak season. Free tiers ration contacts, sends, branching, or support — confirm which ceiling binds your returns and reviews plan first.</p>
